    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/9b605d8ab7e927119f137f2dc3d8a63c.avif?t=1749489560\" width=602 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into interstellar war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Galactic Outlaws, you\u2019re part of an elite squadron tasked with impossible missions: sabotage, high-stakes rescues, and battles against enemy fleets. Choose your ship, customize its loadout, and face dynamic challenges across diverse scenarios\u2014from enemy-infested asteroids to burning space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/c926beb9d81f4b9d52de8e9c62c42da7.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade a fleet of ships, each with distinct weapons and attributes (speed, shields, firepower). Mix modules to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/5e25317027813134df3ff6affe445491.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/5e25317027813134df3ff6affe445491.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/5e25317027813134df3ff6affe445491.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/a6c3393d8e628027e05788ae527385e2.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision lasers, homing missiles, plasma cannons\u2014experiment to find your perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/07e0ebfe3544b209c00c6a25add407ed.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across war-torn planets, asteroid belts, and enemy capital ships, each with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/2f15bc43cba79036f0e0a18c71237bc0.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/2f15bc43cba79036f0e0a18c71237bc0.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/2f15bc43cba79036f0e0a18c71237bc0.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/055d125411cccf2e4e2c0a0bc9db01d7.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your hangar, unlock special abilities, and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/eea94f75c7b46bb75916277b9438c385.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/eea94f75c7b46bb75916277b9438c385.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/eea94f75c7b46bb75916277b9438c385.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/c2135ba10859a76243ae13fa3653de59.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face rival factions with adaptive AI and epic bosses that will test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/9c4595af4e34c163fd466e00532a3dfd.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/9c4595af4e34c163fd466e00532a3dfd.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/9c4595af4e34c163fd466e00532a3dfd.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive this galactic war?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/9b605d8ab7e927119f137f2dc3d8a63c.avif?t=1749489560\" width=602 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into interstellar war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Galactic Outlaws, you\u2019re part of an elite squadron tasked with impossible missions: sabotage, high-stakes rescues, and battles against enemy fleets. Choose your ship, customize its loadout, and face dynamic challenges across diverse scenarios\u2014from enemy-infested asteroids to burning space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/c926beb9d81f4b9d52de8e9c62c42da7.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade a fleet of ships, each with distinct weapons and attributes (speed, shields, firepower). Mix modules to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/5e25317027813134df3ff6affe445491.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/5e25317027813134df3ff6affe445491.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/5e25317027813134df3ff6affe445491.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/a6c3393d8e628027e05788ae527385e2.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision lasers, homing missiles, plasma cannons\u2014experiment to find your perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/07e0ebfe3544b209c00c6a25add407ed.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across war-torn planets, asteroid belts, and enemy capital ships, each with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/2f15bc43cba79036f0e0a18c71237bc0.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/2f15bc43cba79036f0e0a18c71237bc0.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/2f15bc43cba79036f0e0a18c71237bc0.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/055d125411cccf2e4e2c0a0bc9db01d7.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your hangar, unlock special abilities, and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/eea94f75c7b46bb75916277b9438c385.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/eea94f75c7b46bb75916277b9438c385.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/eea94f75c7b46bb75916277b9438c385.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/c2135ba10859a76243ae13fa3653de59.webp?t=1749489560\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face rival factions with adaptive AI and epic bosses that will test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/9c4595af4e34c163fd466e00532a3dfd.poster.avif?t=1749489560\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/9c4595af4e34c163fd466e00532a3dfd.webm?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/9c4595af4e34c163fd466e00532a3dfd.mp4?t=1749489560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive this galactic war?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
